# A hone counter's +1/+0 goes to whatever creature its Equipment is attached to, and only while it is (CR 122.1j, 613.4c; the
# rulings). Dwalin's entering puts a hone counter on Paradise Mantle. Turn 5: equipped to Dwalin, the Mantle makes it 3/1; equipped
# on to Ornithopter, it leaves Dwalin 2/1 and makes Ornithopter 1/2. Turn 6: Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Mantle and Ornithopter
# is 0/2 again.

